  <name>High-end Restaurants</name>
  <description>Michelin Selected and Bib Gourmand</description>
  <Placemark>
   <name>Osteria Piazzetta Cattedrale</name>
   <description><![CDATA[
Modern Apulian
<br>
Price: Around €35 – €50.
<br>
The best table in the White City; incredible local pasta.
<br>
Note: This is considered one of the best bargains in the guide; it feels like a starred meal at a fraction of the price.
<br>
+39 0831 335026
<br>
http://www.piazzettacattedrale.it/
<br>
Largo Arcid Teodoro Trinchera, 7, 72017 Ostuni BR
<br>
Google: 4.4 (477) $$$
<br>
Map: https://tinyurl.com/yyjcfh7k
   ]]></description>
   <styleUrl>#paddle-grn-circle</styleUrl>
   <Point>
    <coordinates>17.57835,40.73425,0</coordinates>
   </Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
   <name>Ristorante Meraviglioso – Ristorante di pesce a Polignano a Mare</name>
   <description><![CDATA[
Contemporary Seafood
<br>
Price: Around €90 for a full tasting; €45 – €55 if eating à la carte.
<br>
High-end seafood in a town famous for it.
<br>
+39 080 424 9509
<br>
http://www.ristorantemeraviglioso.it/
<br>
Largo Gelso, 16, 70044 Polignano a Mare BA
<br>
Google: 4.1 (1279) $$
<br>
Map: https://tinyurl.com/ykpwz3pj
   ]]></description>
   <styleUrl>#paddle-grn-circle</styleUrl>
