  <Placemark>
   <name>Antichi Sapori Montegrosso</name>
   <description><![CDATA[
Near Castel del Monte
<br>
Price: €50 for a massive, multi-course traditional feast.
<br>
Note: This is a "cult" favorite. There is no menu; you eat what Pietro Zito harvested from the garden that morning.
<br>
+39 0883 569529
<br>
http://www.pietrozito.it/
<br>
Piazza Sant'Isidoro, 10, 76123 Montegrosso BT
<br>
Google: 4.8 (1826) $$
<br>
Map: https://tinyurl.com/f5pp8cw6
